      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "### Product & growth: the business view\nFor a VP/product reader: **are people playing, coming back, and is it worth investing in?**\nThis board is deliberately **separate from reliability** (Google's advice): a quiet Tuesday is not an outage and nobody gets paged for it. Reliability lives on **Service health**; the machinery underneath lives on **Platform & dependencies**.\n\n**Read it as a funnel, top to bottom:** is the data trustworthy -> audience -> retention -> funnel -> depth -> experience -> community -> cost.\nAct on the **shape over weeks**, not the last minute.\n\n**Low-traffic caveat:** with a handful of players most panels are **empty or a single spike** at any moment \u2014 normal, not broken. Empty means \"nobody did this in the window\". Widen the range before concluding; 5m/1h rates at this scale are mostly noise.\n\n**Blind vs calm:** a flat line can mean the telemetry stopped, not that players are happy. **Pipeline health** (row 1) is the heartbeat.\nMetrics marked *needs deploy* appear after the next game deploy."
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "row",
      "title": "Pipeline health: is the data trustworthy?",
      "collapsed": false,
      "panels": [],
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 10,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Landing views (24h)",
      "description": "Page loads that reported telemetry in the last 24h \u2014 the top of the funnel and the first sanity check that the beacon works.\nEmpty = no landing views reported yet (or the client that emits `landing_view` is not deployed).",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prom"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 11,
        "w": 6,
        "h": 6
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "noValue": "no landing views yet"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prom"
          },
          "expr": "sum(increase(insight_events_total{event=\"landing_view\"}[24h]))",
          "legendFormat": ""
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ]
        },
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "none"
      }
    },
